@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@correlationId = frontend-contract-example

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{"email":"owner@example.test","firstName":"Ada","lastName":"Owner","password":"replace-at-runtime"}

### Login — copy tokens only into local runtime variables
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{"email":"owner@example.test","password":"replace-at-runtime"}

### Public offers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/sites/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/offers?page=0&size=20
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### Owner sites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sites?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### Payment status; checkout proof is not a JWT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Checkout-Token: {{checkoutToken}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}
